GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`form 10.1 the person does not have to accept the conditions` MEANS
    IF `the person is asked to accept the conditions`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "I do not have to accept the conditions"

-- src:18196 | I understand that I do not have to accept the conditions and that, if I do not accept the conditions, I will be brought before a court, judge, provincial court judge or justice under sections 705 and 706 of the Criminal Code.
