GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`form 11 warning: unless the person has a lawful excuse, failing to follow any of the conditions is an offence under section 145` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the person has a lawful excuse`
        THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "unless you have a lawful excuse"
        IF NOT `the person failed to follow any of the conditions set out in the release order`
